  (text "Only the N8 module is covered. Wheel voltage-domain isolation and hardware-qualified RUN are on sheets 10-12.\nOptical/IMU/RGB circuits must still respect their voltage and power-off requirements.\nGPIO46 stays LOW for download recovery. GPIO45 RGB interface must not pull the strap high during reset."
    (at 20 261 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.05 1.05))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "71d3d389-0189-5b11-8009-2071bee03ed0"))
